": 3.519, "text": "Thanks, Dr. Gade."}, {"start": 4.24, "end": 5.94, "text": "Did you get away over the summer in the end?"}, {"start": 6.521, "end": 6.861, "text": "We did."}, {"start": 7.441, "end": 9.722, "text": "A week by the coast, and we came back on Sunday."}, {"start": 10.302, "end": 11.443, "text": "That sounds restorative."}, {"start": 12.163, "end": 14.704, "text": "It was, though I could have used a second leak."}, {"start": 15.804, "end": 16.605, "text": "Shall we get on with it?"}, {"start": 18.005, "end": 18.826, "text": "Straight to business."}, {"start": 19.846, "end": 21.227, "text": "How have you been feeling in yourself?"}, {"start": 22.087, "end": 23.187, "text": "Good, honestly."}, {"start": 24.108, "end": 24.708, "text": "I feel well."}, {"start": 25.548, "end": 27.809, "text": "I have kept to the diet and the lifestyle side of things."}, {"start": 28.63, "end": 29.65, "text": "That is not nothing."}, {"start": 30.29, "end": 32.011, "text": "It takes real effort to keep that up."}, {"start": 32.732, "end": 36.114, "text": "Maybe, but how much of the picture does that actually account for?"}, {"start": 36.855, "end": 38.836, "text": "A good deal, and we can see it today."}, {"start": 39.516, "end": 40.557, "text": "Your weight is stable."}, {"start": 41.518, "end": 43.519, "text": "Stable compared with when, exactly?"}, {"start": 44.44, "end": 46.121, "text": "Compared with your earlier readings here."}, {"start": 46.721, "end": 48.362, "text": "There has been no meaningful change."}, {"start": 49.323, "end": 51.064, "text": "Alright, and the blood test?"}, {"start": 51.845, "end": 55.647, "text": "Your hemoglobin A1c is 43 millimoles per mole."}, {"start": 56.508, "end": 57.729, "text": "And what is that based on?"}, {"start": 58.389, "end": 59.25, "text": "One single sample?"}, {"start": 60.05, "end": 64.833, "text": "It comes from your blood sample, and it reflects your average over recent months rather than one day."}, {"start": 65.694, "end": 67.555, "text": "That is a fair measure, I suppose."}, {"start": 68.436, "end": 69.437, "text": "It is why we use it."}, {"start": 70.337, "end": 74.48, "text": "Taken together, your diabetes is stable, with good self-care on your part."}, {"start": 75.321, "end": 78.343, "text": "You are confident about that, and not simply being kind?"}, {"start": 79.384, "end": 80.184, "text": "I am confident."}, {"start": 80.764, "end": 83.747, "text": "The findings support it, and I would tell you if they did not."}, {"start": 84.667, "end": 85.168, "text": "Fair enough."}, {"start": 85.868, "end": 86.889, "text": "So, what changes?"}, {"start": 87.789, "end": 88.49, "text": "Nothing changes."}, {"start": 89.238, "end": 93.022, "text": "We continue your treatment unchanged and keep to the regular checkups."}, {"start": 93.923, "end": 94.883, "text": "No adjustment at all?"}, {"start": 95.824, "end": 97.726, "text": "I half expected you to tinker with something."}, {"start": 98.567, "end": 99.568, "text": "There is no reason to."}, {"start": 100.709, "end": 102.15, "text": "What are you doing with the rest of your day?"}, {"start": 102.291, "end": 103.292, "text": "Unpacking, mostly."}, {"start": 104.052, "end": 105.694, "text": "The suitcase is still standing in the hall."}, {"start": 106.435, "end": 107.796, "text": "Then I will not keep you."}, {"start": 108.677, "end": 109.578, "text": "Take care, Hana."}, {"start": 110.298, "end": 110.619, "text": "Thanks."}, {"start": 111.179, "end": 112.02, "text": "See you at the next one."}], "machine": "gpu59.int.triton.aalto.fi", "git_commit": "735eed3a1a4f5d8bc8a3ac1f1c8897e291443b9f", "date": "2026-09-20", "timing_s": {"transcribe_and_align": 2.099}}